WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400
Proxy Farm — turn your VPN plan into dozens of proxies, one IP per port

2
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:10.085
1. Add ExpressVPN — open the step-by-step credential guide

3
00:00:10.085 --> 00:00:17.439
1. Enter the username/password (masked), then press “Check”

4
00:00:17.589 --> 00:00:25.557
2. Pick a location — every port gets its own server and its own IP

5
00:00:25.557 --> 00:00:36.644
2. Vietnam, Japan, Singapore, USA: five ports come online one by one

6
00:00:36.794 --> 00:00:43.524
3. Each port is a SOCKS5/HTTP proxy — curl returns its exit IP

7
00:00:43.524 --> 00:00:50.562
4. Change IP: same port, another server, a new exit IP

8
00:00:50.562 --> 00:00:53.262
5. Import a test WireGuard file (unreachable server) to get a dead port

9
00:00:53.262 --> 00:00:58.312
5. Check all: a summary of alive and dead ports

10
00:00:58.312 --> 00:01:04.245
5. Filter by status: “Dead”, then “Alive”

11
00:01:04.245 --> 00:01:08.278
5. Search by location, IP or port: “viet”

12
00:01:08.378 --> 00:01:20.612
6. Export → CSV → Alive only → Save to file

13
00:01:20.612 --> 00:01:24.412
